{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"main","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Given one argument, a directory, it writes the plan there, as ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/write(to:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does: it exits with status 0 once the plan is written, and 73 (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EX_CANTCREAT"},{"text":") when a file","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can’t be written.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":" and a directory, it compares the plan with the one committed there, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" does, printing the check’s report when they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"differ: it exits with status 0 when they match, 1 when a difference is breaking, and 2 when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the committed plan is only out of date."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check --breaking-only"},{"type":"text","text":" and a directory, it compares them the same way but fails only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when a difference is breaking: it exits with status 1 then, printing the report, and 0 when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they match or the plan there is only out of date. It prints the differences of an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out-of-date plan to standard output, as information."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given anything else, it exits with status 64 ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EX_USAGE"},{"type":"text","text":"): "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":" alone (write to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".\/check"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for a directory of that name), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check --breaking-only"},{"type":"text","text":" alone, the flag in any other place,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or a directory whose name starts with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-"},{"type":"text","text":", as a mistyped option would (write "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".\/-name"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one). When "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand\/trackingPlan"},{"type":"text","text":" throws, it exits with status 65 ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EX_DATAERR"},{"type":"text","text":"). Every failure is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"printed to standard error."}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand\/main()"},"abstract":[{"text":"Writes or checks ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand\/trackingPlan"},{"text":" as the command’s arguments say, and exits.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplancommand\/main()"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlans"}],"extendedModule":"Tr